# Structure

- Shared code must have real consumers; do not create abstractions for hypothetical reuse.
- Do not add unnecessary wrapper layers or parallel types.
- UI files under `apps/web/features/**` over 500 lines must be split by UI concern.
- For structural add, delete, split, or move work, load [`repository-structure`](../../.agents/skills/repository-structure/SKILL.md).
